[[File:Elder custodian stalker icon.png|left]]
'''Elder custodian stalkers''' are [[Slayer monster]]s that require level 76 [[Slayer]] to kill. They are found in the [[Stalker Den]] near [[Auburnvale]]. They are an elder version of the [[Strange creature (Shadows of Custodia)|strange creature]] fought during the quest [[Shadows of Custodia]]. They drop the unique [[alchemist's signet]] as well as the [[antler guard]].

Elder [[Custodian stalker|custodian stalkers]] primarily attack with melee. Once they reach 20% health, they can perform a special attack where they stomp the ground and douse the player in spores. The attack can miss or be blocked by [[Protect from Magic]], but if it hits, it will cause the player to [[bleed]] for 9 total damage over 15 [[Game tick|ticks]] (9 seconds). It is the same as the bleed applied by [[Vardorvis]]' attacks and can stack. If the player moves while bleeding, additional bleed damage will occur on every tick they are moving.

Overall, it is recommended to use [[Protect from Melee]], as the guaranteed 9 damage from the special attack is relatively minor compared to damage that would be taken from melee over the course of a kill. Gear with high magic defence, such as [[dragonhide armour]], can be beneficial to reduce the chances of taking damage from this attack. [[Bones to Peaches]] can also allow the player to sustain longer trips with only prayer gear and potions. 

For faster kills per hour, it is recommended to use a [[Dwarf multicannon]] in the multicombat area.

